### Armor Boons

The following boons may be applied to armor and clothing.

#### Agility of Legend

#### Burst of Force

When you make a check to resist a critical strike while wearing this armor, you may spend ⚙⚙. If you do so during a skirmish, each character at range 1–3 of you suffers supernatural damage equal to your bonus successes on the check and is pushed one range band away from you. If you do so during a mass battle, the enemy army suffers attrition and panic equal to your bonus successes. After the check is resolved, the implement is dispelled.

